<tr><td class="hm-pad" style="padding:32px 32px 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#0b1f1e;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><h1 class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.48px;color:#0b1f1e">You&#39;re invited to Sodax Labs on Journear Passport</h1><p class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#0b1f1e">You have been invited to join Sodax Labs (org_1) in the Journear Passport partner console as an owner, by an owner of the organisation<span>.</span><wbr></p><p class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#0b1f1e">Accepting adds you to the organisation<span>.</span><wbr> Owners change apps, keys and members; if it already has an owner, you are a viewer (who sees everything and changes nothing) until a waiting period ends, and its owners are told and can cancel it<span>.</span><wbr></p><p class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#0b1f1e">Sign in with the Google account of this address<span>.</span><wbr> The invitation expires on 17 November 2026, 09:00 UTC<span>.</span><wbr></p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:4px 0 0;border-collapse:separate"><tr><td class="hm-btn" align="center" bgcolor="#0f766e" style="border-radius:8px;background-color:#0f766e"><a class="hm-btn-a" href="https://console.test/invite#t=abc_DEF-123" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fcfdfd;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px">Accept the invitation</a></td></tr></table><p class="hm-muted" style="margin:12px 0 20px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5f6f6a">Or copy this address into your browser:<br><span class="hm-host hm-ink2" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono','Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#46534f;word-break:break-all">https:<span>/</span><wbr><span>/</span><wbr>console<span>.</span><wbr>test<span>/</span><wbr>invite<span>#</span><wbr>t<span>=</span><wbr>abc_DEF-123</span></p><p class="hm-ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#0b1f1e">The link works once, for this address only<span>.</span><wbr> If you were not expecting this, ignore this email<span>.</span><wbr></p></td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
